<BaseLayout title="About | Artem Kachan" description="About Artem Kachan, software developer, educational technologist, researcher, and tutor."><main class="page section"><a class="text-link" href="/">← Home</a><div class="section-heading" style="margin-top:4rem"><div class="eyebrow">About</div><h1 class="case-title">I like systems that become simpler as they become more capable.</h1></div><figure class="about-photo"><img src="/images/artem-kachan.webp" width="1600" height="919" loading="eager" decoding="async" alt="Artem Kachan holding a tablet" /></figure><div class="case-content"><section><h2>What I work on</h2><p>I'm Artem Kachan, a software developer, educational technologist, researcher, and tutor based in Kyiv. My work connects product engineering, educational systems, applied AI, and research.</p></section><section><h2>How I build</h2><p>I research how people currently handle a problem, design a system around that reality, build it, then keep changing it once real users expose what the first version missed.</p></section><section><h2>Teaching & community</h2><p>I teach English remotely, provide volunteer English-language support for Ukrainian refugees in Ireland, and previously ran a 15,000-member online community with moderation, onboarding, recruitment, and automation systems.</p></section><section><h2>Languages</h2><p>Ukrainian - Native<br/>Russian - Native<br/>English - C1<br/>Polish - B2+</p></section></div></main></BaseLayout>
